{"symbol":"ENP.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-09T19:50:08Z","info":{"address1":"ul. gen. K. Pulaskiego","city":"Katowice","zip":"40-273","country":"Poland","phone":"48 32 728 5410","website":"https://www.enap.com.pl","industry":"Engineering & Construction","industryKey":"engineering-construction","industryDisp":"Engineering & Construction","sector":"Industrials","sectorKey":"industrials","sectorDisp":"Industrials","longBusinessSummary":"Energoaparatura SA provides specialized construction and assembly services in Poland. The company offers electrical power services, such as construction, repair, and modernization of HV, MV, and LV stations and distribution boards; control, measurement, and commissioning works; execution of electrical installations; construction of low-current installations; construction of the MV/HV GPO station, and HV and MV cable lines and fiber optic lines; and obtaining EON, ION, and FON permits. It also provides electrical power equipment, including automation devices, signals, relays, service cases, converters, enap express, and accessories; mining equipment and services comprising compressor and transformer units, contactor starters, sensors, and signaling and control devices; prefabrication of control and distribution cabinets; and industrial cables and wires. In addition, the company offers development of design documentation; measuring controllers and making prefabricated assembly elements; completion of supplies, equipment and materials; assembly work; regulation and measurement works; and preparation of as-built documentation. Energoaparatura SA was founded in 1955 and is headquartered in Katowice, Poland.","fullTimeEmployees":84,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Tomasz  Michalik","age":52,"title":"CEO & Chairman of Management Board","yearBorn":1973,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Barbara  Kozlik","title":"Chief Accountant of Procurator","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":